  "second_temple_context": "",
  "canonical_context": "Psalm 27 uses darkness as a threat from which the speaker trusts God for deliverance. John 1 presents darkness in relation to the light that shines; Ephesians 5 turns the image toward conduct; 1 John 1 uses it to challenge a contradiction between speech and behavior. The image thus moves from danger to revelation and moral consistency.",
